  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Document Editor is a feature-rich word processor control that enables viewing and editing of Word documents (DOCX) directly in the browser. It supports rich text formatting, tables, images, headers, footers, bookmarks, hyperlinks, track changes, comments, find and replace, mail merge, table of contents, spell check, and collaborative editing. The control provides a Microsoft Word-like editing experience and is ideal for document management, report generation, and content authoring applications built on ASP.NET MVC.",
